      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# 🎯 SemiShape QLoRA Fine-tuning Notebook\n",
        "\n",
        "**Model**: IBM Granite 4.0 H Micro\n",
        "**Library**: Unsloth (optimalizované pro Google Colab)\n",
        "**Dataset**: build123d bilinguální (cs/en)\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 📋 Požadavky\n",
        "- Google Colab **T4 GPU** nebo lepší (A100 ideální)\n",
        "- ~2-4 hodiny tréninku\n",
        "- Dataset nahraný na HuggingFace Hub nebo Google Drive\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "header_cell"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 1️⃣ Instalace závislostí"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "install_header"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "install_code"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# Instalace Unsloth (optimalizované QLoRA)\n",
        "%%capture\n",
        "import os\n",
        "if 'COLAB_' not in os.environ:  # Pokud nejsem v Colab\n",
        "    !pip install unsloth\n",
        "else:  # V Colab - použít optimized instalaci\n",
        "    !pip install --no-deps bitsandbytes accelerate xformers==0.0.29 peft transformers==4.45.2 trl==0.11.1\n",
        "    !pip install --no-deps torch==2.4.1 --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu124\n",
        "    !pip install \"unsloth[colab-new] @ git+https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth.git\"\n",
        "\n",
        "# Volitelné: Pro rychlejší inference\n",
        "!pip install --no-deps flash-attn==2.6.3 --no-build-isolation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 2️⃣ Načtení modelu"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "model_header"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "model_code"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "from unsloth import FastLanguageModel\n",
        "import torch\n",
        "\n",
        "# Granite 4.0 H Micro - vyzkoušejte různé velikosti:\n",
        "# - \"ibm-granite/granite-4.0-h-micro\" (nejmenší, nejrychlejší)\n",
        "# - \"ibm-granite/granite-4.0-h-mini\" (střední)\n",
        "\n",
        "max_seq_length = 2048  # Délka kontextu - může zvýšit pro delší kód\n",
        "dtype = None  # Auto-detekce\n",
        "load_in_4bit = True  # QLoRA 4-bit kvantizace\n",
        "\n",
        "model, tokenizer = FastLanguageModel.from_pretrained(\n",
        "    model_name = \"ibm-granite/granite-4.0-h-micro\",\n",
        "    max_seq_length = max_seq_length,\n",
        "    dtype = dtype,\n",
        "    load_in_4bit = load_in_4bit,\n",
        "    # token = \"hf_...\",  # Pokud je model private\n",
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 3️⃣ Konfigurace LoRA adapterů"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "lora_header"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "lora_code"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "model = FastLanguageModel.get_peft_model(\n",
        "    model,\n",
        "    r = 16,  # LoRA rank - 8, 16, 32, 64 (vyšší = více parametrů)\n",
        "    target_modules = [\"q_proj\", \"k_proj\", \"v_proj\", \"o_proj\",\n",
        "                      \"gate_proj\", \"up_proj\", \"down_proj\"],\n",
        "    lora_alpha = 32,  # Obvykle 2x rank\n",
        "    lora_dropout = 0.05,\n",
        "    bias = \"none\",\n",
        "    use_gradient_checkpointing = \"unsloth\",\n",
        "    random_state = 42,\n",
        "    use_rslora = True,  # Rank stabilized LoRA\n",
        "    loftq_config = None,\n",
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 4️⃣ Příprava datasetu"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "dataset_header"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "dataset_code"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "from datasets import load_dataset\n",
        "import json\n",
        "\n",
        "# MOŽNOST A: Nahrát z HuggingFace Hub\n",
        "# dataset = load_dataset(\"your-username/semishape-build123d\", split=\"train\")\n",
        "\n",
        "# MOŽNOST B: Nahrát z Google Drive\n",
        "from google.colab import drive\n",
        "drive.mount('/content/drive')\n",
        "\n",
        "# Cesta k datasetu\n",
        "dataset_path = \"/content/drive/MyDrive/semishape/unsloth_combined_train.json\"\n",
        "\n",
        "# Načtení datasetu\n",
        "with open(dataset_path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n",
        "    data = json.load(f)\n",
        